---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import "../../styles/docs.css";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base
	title="Command palette | Actual Budget Tweaks"
	description="Search, do quick math and run actions from the command palette in Actual Budget Tweaks."
>
	<main class="docs center">
		<header class="docs__header stack stack--sm">
			<a href="/guides" class="docs__back">Back to guides</a>
			<h1>Command palette</h1>
			<p class="docs__lead">
				The command palette finds accounts, pages and settings, does quick math, and runs common
				actions without leaving the keyboard. It comes with the Live sidebar and replaces Actual's
				own <code>Cmd+K</code> menu.
			</p>
		</header>

		<section class="docs__section">
			<h2>Find anything</h2>
			<ol>
				<li>Press <code>Cmd+K</code> or <code>Ctrl+K</code>, or click the search bar in the sidebar.</li>
				<li>Type to filter the list.</li>
				<li>Press <code>Enter</code> to choose.</li>
			</ol>
			<div class="docs__stage docs__stage--dialog">
				<img
					src={`${base}images/guides/palette.png`}
					width="600"
					height="440"
					alt="The command palette listing accounts with their balances and pages to go to"
				/>
			</div>
			<p>The list includes:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Accounts and custom reports</li>
				<li>Pages</li>
				<li>The calculator, currency converter and interest calculator</li>
				<li>Actions such as syncing all accounts, changing the theme and hiding amounts</li>
			</ul>
			<p>Press <code>Esc</code> to close the palette or go back.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="docs__section">
			<h2>Do quick math</h2>
			<p>Type a sum and press <code>Enter</code> to copy the answer.</p>
			<div class="docs__stage docs__stage--dialog">
				<img
					src={`${base}images/guides/palette-math.png`}
					width="600"
					height="159"
					alt="The command palette showing the answer to 145.20 times 12"
				/>
			</div>
			<p>It also handles:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Percentages, such as <code>200 * 15%</code></li>
				<li>Pasted amounts with commas or a currency symbol</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="docs__section">
			<h2>Change a setting or start a reconcile</h2>
			<p>Type at least two letters to search ABT's settings.</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Choosing a switch turns it on or off and keeps the palette open.</li>
				<li>Choosing any other setting opens it in Tweaks.</li>
			</ul>
			<div class="docs__stage docs__stage--dialog">
				<img
					src={`${base}images/guides/palette-tweaks.png`}
					width="600"
					height="284"
					alt="The command palette searching for reconcile, showing the Reconcile account action and three settings marked On"
				/>
			</div>
			<p>With <a href="/guides/modern-reconcile">Reconcile panel</a> on, choose <strong>Reconcile account</strong> and pick an account to start.</p>
		</section>
	</main>
</Base>
